# A Postgres connection string from any provider — Supabase, Neon, Railway,
# a local Postgres instance, etc. If you're also using the Supabase extra,
# grab this from: Supabase dashboard -> Project settings -> Database ->
# Connection string (use the pooled "Transaction" mode URI, not the direct
# connection, so you don't exhaust the connection limit under serverless
# functions).
